C ELM0E               ACCUMULATED EFFECTS
C
C LV           DERIVATIVE OF THE LENGTH OF AN ELEMENT WRT VARIED PARAMETER.
C DPARM        DERIVATIVE OF ELEMENT PARAMETER WRT TO VARIED PARAMETER
C TOTANG       TOTAL ANGLE -- NOT USED.
C LCV(NPVAR)   DERIVATIVE OF ACCUMULATED LENGTH
C LUP(3)       ACCUMULATED LENGTH AT LAST UPDATE
C
      REAL            LV, DPARM, TOTANG, LCV(NPVAR), LUP(3)
C
      COMMON /ELM0E/  LV, DPARM, TOTANG, LCV, LUP
